824
00:44:52,857 --> 00:44:54,090
Cocaine.

825
00:44:54,159 --> 00:44:56,558
Looks like about four ounces.

826
00:44:56,628 --> 00:45:01,196
What the hell's cocaine doing...

827
00:45:03,034 --> 00:45:04,567
Well, surely you...

828
