840
00:45:33,965 --> 00:45:36,165
Now, you will speak
when you're spoken to.

841
00:45:36,234 --> 00:45:37,299
You understand?

842
00:45:37,368 --> 00:45:38,401
I understand.

843
00:45:38,470 --> 00:45:40,970
