845
00:45:42,540 --> 00:45:44,172
I said you'll speak when...

846
00:45:44,242 --> 00:45:45,608
You spoke to me!

847
00:45:47,845 --> 00:45:49,945
The charge is illegal possession

848
00:45:50,014 --> 00:45:51,113
