897
00:47:40,425 --> 00:47:43,592
Yeah. Keep cool.

898
00:47:43,661 --> 00:47:45,694
Yeah. Yeah.

899
00:47:47,465 --> 00:47:49,698
Keep cool.

900
00:47:51,101 --> 00:47:52,813
<i>Mmm, boy. That was good.</i>

901
00:47:52,837 --> 00:47:55,148
Yeah, you were just hungry.

902
00:47:55,172 --> 00:47:58,040
Nothing evens a man out
