906
00:48:02,714 --> 00:48:04,179
Conrad, you're a good cook.

907
00:48:04,248 --> 00:48:07,383
Some girl's gonna
be lucky to get you.

908
00:48:07,452 --> 00:48:10,012
Well, if I say so
myself, who shouldn't.

909
00:48:10,054 --> 00:48:11,554
