One more time.

1003
00:52:12,062 --> 00:52:14,622
Yes, sir.

1004
00:52:18,969 --> 00:52:20,903
Having a bad day?

1005
00:52:24,275 --> 00:52:26,835
Happens to the best of us.

1006
00:52:28,378 --> 00:52:31,146
