morning from Richmond.

1010
00:52:39,589 --> 00:52:41,389
Welcome to Dare County.

1011
00:52:41,459 --> 00:52:43,224
David Channing.

1012
00:52:43,293 --> 00:52:45,160
Michelle Thomas.

1013
