1014
00:52:51,068 --> 00:52:53,035
I don't know.

1015
00:52:53,103 --> 00:52:55,663
Couple weeks, maybe longer.

1016
00:52:57,374 --> 00:52:59,641
You here by yourself?

1017
00:52:59,710 --> 00:53:01,243
So far.

1018
00:53:07,218 --> 00:53:09,218
Maybe we could have dinner.

1019
00:53:12,122 --> 00:53:14,022
Maybe.

1020
00:53:17,461 --> 00:53:18,960
Ben Matlock, hey.

1021
00:53:19,030 --> 00:53:20,173
Yeah. Hey, Ben.

1022
00:53:20,197 --> 00:53:21,130
Yeah?

1023
00:53:21,198 --> 00:53:22,464
I got something to tell you

1024
00:53:22,533 --> 00:53:23,932
