1056
00:55:02,566 --> 00:55:04,199
Real estate.

1057
00:55:04,268 --> 00:55:07,202
I buy property,
develop it, sell.

1058
00:55:09,273 --> 00:55:11,673
Ah.

1059
00:55:11,742 --> 00:55:13,708
Don't go away.

1060
00:55:42,540 --> 00:55:45,440
Uh, yeah, I've got it.

1061
00:55:45,509 --> 00:55:47,776
2:00, Bags Bay.

1062
00:55:52,616 --> 00:55:54,616
Yeah, I've got it.

1063
00:56:00,257 --> 00:56:02,817
Make it a twin if you can.

1064
00:56:04,327 --> 00:56:05,505
Okay.

1065
00:56:05,529 --> 00:56:07,362
See you tomorrow.

1066
00:56:11,769 --> 00:56:13,869
Thought you were
admiring the view.

1067
00:56:13,938 --> 00:56:15,703
It's getting chilly outside.

1068
00:56:15,772 --> 00:56:18,332
That's fine. That's fine.

1069
00:56:19,109 --> 00:56:21,843
Let's get the
champagne, and then...

1070
00:56:21,912 --> 00:56:24,879
